{
  "_about": "GB-239 (D-94): the weapons from Jerry's Real Firearms Sounds (and its Bullet Sound FX). Picked by analysis (onset, the -20/-30 dB tail, top-end share; qa/2026-10-26-GB-239/pack-analysis.tsv), not by ear: the listen page judges them. Shots end where their envelope is 30 dB down or at the cap in the why, whichever is first (the game adds distance and reverb). Sound rule: every shot and impact is impactful; foley and the whiz immersive. Family: military mechanical and close. Left to Jerry's or the synth: mortar-launch, flamethrower, chainsaw, knife/machete, grenade pin/bounce, mag-slap, mag-drop, pump-back/forward, slide-back, dry-fire, suppressor-on, laser-click, wheel-tick, shotgun-hull, belt-feed, heavy-turret-fire, the mortar crew, the katana's draw: the pack has nothing of their kind.",
